,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194399665,"data":"Ready: saved OOF priors, 6 research directions, CPU, 240-minute cap; no classifier training.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194448555,"data":"# PROTEUS: causal transduction over saved held-out priors\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.19445573,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194460618,"data":"No classifier training, no new control runs, no reproduction-tolerance gates.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.19446596,"data":"Private Kaggle CPU notebook; 4 workers; 240-minute wall cap. No submission.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194470824,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194475272,"data":"## Inputs and evaluation\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194479754,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194484058,"data":"Saved Lag4 probabilities and two SWAD.1 CNN seed logits, from the prior 11\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194488935,"data":"outer folds. Two priors: Lag4; and .7 Lag4 + .3 mean softmax(CNN logits / 4).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194493685,"data":"No final balance is applied before transduction. Warm-up/fallback uses our\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194498387,"data":"existing causal balance1 with prior10, reset for each person/session.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194502945,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194507471,"data":"Main metric: pooled OOF mean balanced accuracy per person/session/context,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194511705,"data":"all 10 LOSO people. Mean-person LOSO and later_last are separate diagnostics.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194516253,"data":"Scores are computed only after emitting predictions. Public CV has already\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194521137,"data":"been reused repeatedly: this is exploratory research, not sealed confirmation.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.19452556,"data":"No configuration is selected or changed in response to intermediate scores.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194530148,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.19453453,"data":"## Six research directions\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194538907,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194543043,"data":"1. Author's causal Gram-PCA -\u003e soft-LDA -\u003e balanced assignment transducer:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194548492,"data":"   5 bands, k20, warm20, 5 self-labelling iterations, shrinkage .5, beta1.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194553218,"data":"2. Relax equal prefix class mass: scaling exponent tau=0,.25,.5,.75,1;\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194573518,"data":"   slower onset, 50/80-window warm-up, .5/1/2 beta, half-strength adaptation.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194578501,"data":"   Intermediate tau uses KL-relaxed column scaling, not a claim to reproduce\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194583421,"data":"   any particular unbalanced-OT EEG method.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.19458883,"data":"3. Ordinary 41-channel vs Lag4 82-dimensional covariances, and equal-weight\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194594008,"data":"   two-view Gram fusion. Each view is trace-normalized on the current prefix.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.19459903,"data":"4. Stored running-anchor features vs fixed training anchor vs common log-cov\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194603785,"data":"   coordinates; prior5 vs prior20. Fixed and log charts have common coordinates;\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194608833,"data":"   running charts reproduce the author's stored-feature convention.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194613821,"data":"5. Class-balanced reference: maintain three soft log-covariance sums/masses\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194618371,"data":"   using frozen Lag4 pseudo-probabilities, average the three class means with\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194624604,"data":"   equal weights, shrink to source mean with total prior5. Also test sharpened\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194629303,"data":"   probabilities (p squared). This is a new hypothesis motivated by SPDIM's\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194634115,"data":"   label-shift analysis, not an implementation of SPDIM.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194638947,"data":"6. Ordinary/Lag4 prediction fusion and stability weighting: mean predictions,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194643733,"data":"   half strength, or shrink toward fallback by exp(-JS/.05) / exp(-JS/.2).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194648593,"data":"   Agreement is a reliability heuristic, not a correctness guarantee.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194653255,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194657767,"data":"13 geometries x 8 shared settings, plus 14 targeted robustness settings:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194662632,"data":"118 transduction configurations. Four two-view/stability combinations and\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194667604,"data":"one existing fallback = 123 configurations per prior, 246 total, 2706\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194672515,"data":"outer-fold evaluations. No classifier fitting is included in that count.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194677387,"data":"Settings are fixed before the run. Joint settings vary k10/20/30 and LDA\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194682337,"data":"shrinkage .2/.5/.8 only for the two most relevant geometries.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194687238,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194691785,"data":"## Causality and computation\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194696523,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194701052,"data":"Source log-covariance means exclude the outer evaluation windows. Caches are\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194706044,"data":"pure single-window filter/OAS/log transforms. Pseudo reference uses only the\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194711247,"data":"current/past window's frozen Lag4 probabilities, never target labels. State\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194715505,"data":"resets at every person/session. Gram matrices may be precomputed as a speed\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194720221,"data":"optimization, but every PCA/normalization/assignment sees only its leading\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.19472931,"data":"current prefix. Past emitted predictions are never revised.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194734217,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.1947383,"data":"CPU batching shares PCA across independent hyperparameters/priors; every case\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194742845,"data":"has independent pseudo-label iterations. NumPy/SciPy handle small linear\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.19478427,"data":"systems; a GPU would mostly sit idle. No GPU hours are requested.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.19478965,"data":"Completed folds are saved and summarized even if another fold errors or\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194794435,"data":"reaches the wall cap. Rankings require all ten LOSO folds. No partial-fold\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194799283,"data":"score is presented as complete. Figures show ranking and person deltas,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194803948,"data":"not train/validation loss: this experiment has no training epochs.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194809125,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194812791,"data":"## Sources\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194817234,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194821558,"data":"- DorinDaniil/Brain-Decoding, commit ca5d3d0045120b426f77437d48c374f57d7cce45:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194826208,"data":"  https://github.com/DorinDaniil/Brain-Decoding/tree/ca5d3d0045120b426f77437d48c374f57d7cce45/track2_bci/transduction\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194831475,"data":"- SPDIM, ICLR 2025: https://proceedings.iclr.cc/paper_files/paper/2025/hash/fc6cd575b8340be6ee70beaed9ca4015-Abstract-Conference.html\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194836462,"data":"- Chizat et al., unbalanced transport scaling: https://arxiv.org/abs/1607.05816\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194841041,"data":"- Competition streaming contract: https://github.com/neural-interfaces26/2026-competition/blob/main/codabench/pages/scientific_faq_bci.md\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194845808,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194850221,"data":"TSMNet/SPD normalization with new neural training remains a separate more\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194855135,"data":"expensive research direction; it is not represented by the pseudo-reference\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194859932,"data":"or the post-hoc transducer here. No claim of running TSMNet is made.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.194864678,"data":"\n"}
